OL,3,GNEWSAChain ferry refit schedule delayed
OL,4,Aby weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major refit on a chain ferry has been
OL,7,Fdelayed by a week due to the weather.
OL,9,FThe Sandbanks Ferry, which crosses the
OL,10,Fentrance to Poole Harbour, closed for
OL,11,Fscheduled maintenance at the start of
OL,12,FNovember.
OL,14,FThe works were expected to take seven
OL,15,Fweeks but rain in Falmouth, where the
OL,16,Frefit took place, delayed the paint
OL,17,Fworks, and adverse sea conditions meant
OL,18,Ftugs had to wait for a weather window
OL,19,Fbefore towing the vessel back to Poole.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
