OL,3,GNEWSAChain ferry refit schedule delayed
OL,4,Aby weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FBournemouth Swanage Motor Road and
OL,7,FFerry Company said it hoped to
OL,8,Faccelerate the remaining works and get
OL,9,Fthe ferry back in service before
OL,10,FChristmas.
